src/verify.rs is derived from toon-protocol/zk-note-vectors
rust/mesa-toon-1512/src/main.rs at commit
384a0907078edb50ff840805a7011cae055c28b8, which builds on mina-rust
(https://github.com/o1-labs/mina-rust, Apache-2.0) through the fork
toon-protocol/mina-rust at rev 6feeb3797fff6dba49fd848cb2d6decd63fee1b4.

The files under src/wrap/ are derived from the Pickles wrap prover in
toon-protocol/mina-rust at rev 6feeb3797fff6dba49fd848cb2d6decd63fee1b4
(crates/ledger/src/proofs/{wrap,step,prover,opt_sponge,group_map,transaction}.rs
and public_input/plonk_checks.rs), which is derived from o1-labs/mina-rust
v0.19.0 (Apache-2.0), and follow the OCaml Pickles code of MinaProtocol/mina at
commit 228c409a1696669d963425162f12e88d41231c6d (the commit o1js v3.1.0
bundles). src/wrap/constant_term.rs is generated by gen/constant_term.py from that
commit's src/lib/crypto/pickles/plonk_checks/scalars.ml (Apache-2.0).
Each file names its sources in its header.

