src/witness/step_verifier.rs and src/witness/previous_proof.rs are derived from the Pickles step prover in
toon-protocol/mina-rust at the same rev (crates/ledger/src/proofs/step.rs, which is derived from o1-labs/mina-rust
v0.19.0, Apache-2.0), and follow the OCaml `step_main.ml` and `step_verifier.ml` of MinaProtocol/mina at commit
228c409a1696669d963425162f12e88d41231c6d. src/witness/constant_term.rs is generated by gen/constant_term.py from that
commit's src/lib/crypto/pickles/plonk_checks/scalars.ml (Apache-2.0). `prove_step_verifying` in src/lib.rs is
derived from `create_proof` in crates/ledger/src/proofs/transaction.rs. Each file names its sources in its header.

src/witness mirrors, in Rust, gadgets of o1js (https://github.com/o1-labs/o1js, Apache-2.0) and the
Pickles and snarky sources of Mina (https://github.com/MinaProtocol/mina, Apache-2.0) at the commit
o1js 3.1.0 builds on (see src/pins.rs). `endo_4` in src/witness/pickles.rs is derived from
`endo_cvar` in crates/ledger/src/proofs/transaction.rs of mina-rust at the fork rev above (Apache-2.0).
